# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Seros product repository.
#
# This repository has no application code yet and no chosen language, so this
# file is deliberately broad: it covers the common ecosystems so that the first
# accidental artefact from a spike does not end up committed. Trim it once
# ADR 0003 is accepted and the stack is known.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

